    answer: 'Part B begins on the first day of your 65th birthday month only if you enroll during the three months prior. Signing up during your birthday month or the three months after delays Part B to the first day of the following month. Premium-free Part A starts your birthday month and can backdate up to six months, but never before the month you turned 65.',
